    "T3": {
      "category": "timing_signoff",
      "truth": "No. The routed LibreLane run in the copy (m4_e5_1, current RTL and SDC, IHP SG13G2) fails setup at the slow corner nom_slow_1p08V_125C: WNS -0.725 ns, TNS -7.85 ns, 26 violating endpoints. Typical (+2.354 ns) and fast (+4.12 ns) corners and hold (min +0.101 ns) pass; DRC (Magic 0, KLayout 0), LVS (match) and antenna (0) are clean. Pre-PnR (synthesis) estimates do not support signoff. Not in the evidence at all: gate-level simulation with post-route SDF and activity-based (VCD/SAIF) power; the 13.7 mW figure is vectorless.",
      "evidence": ["eval-f/_gt/T3_flow_report.txt (eda-agent flow-report on the GT copy of m4_e5_1)", "eda-agent-m4 hand-over note m4_e5_1"],
